This project is a Full Stack Doctor Appointment Booking System built using the MERN stack – MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, and Node.js. It is a complete web application that allows patients to book appointments with doctors, doctors to manage appointments and earnings, and administrators to oversee the entire system.

🚀 Features
Three-Level Authentication System:

Patient Dashboard: Patients can sign up, log in, book appointments with doctors, view their appointments, and manage them easily.

Doctor Dashboard: Doctors can log in to view their appointments, earnings, and update their profile.

Admin Dashboard: Admins have full control over the system including managing doctors and viewing all appointments.

Online Payment Integration:

Patients can pay their appointment fees directly through the application via integrated online payment gateways.

Responsive UI:

The front end is built with React.js to provide a smooth and responsive user experience on all devices.

🎓 Ideal For
College or academic projects

Personal portfolio to demonstrate full stack development skills

Resume enhancement for aspiring MERN developers

🛠️ Technologies Used
Frontend: React.js

Backend: Node.js, Express.js

Database: MongoDB

